-- Antorus: killed trash came back on a saved lockout (Refs #63, Claude 2026-09-28). Respawn times are saved per
-- instance (characters.creature_respawn), but every Antorus spawn had spawntimesecs 14400, so trash returned 4 hours
-- after it died. The 104 attackable hostile spawns (faction 14/16, not unselectable, not immune to players) get a week
-- like the Tomb of Sargeras trash, so they stay dead until the weekly reset (the reset deletes the respawn times).
-- Bosses already had 604800; friendly NPCs, critters and stalkers keep 14400. Applies to kills after the restart.
-- Undo: undo_antorus_trash_respawn_63.sql (all 104 were 14400, checked 2026-09-28).
